# Release 2026-11-03 (Vasanthgogox V1.0.1): two migrations for this release.
# 1. fix_chat_participants_auth_guard: EXISTS guard on chat_participants inserts — prevents FK violation
#    when organization_members or drivers carry orphaned user_ids not in auth.users (PR #78).
# 2. record_trip_assigner_on_driver_change: records assigner user IDs on driver reassignment (PR #77).
#
# Apply only via: npm run db:push-set -- prod-2026-11-03   (dry-run first; apply needs Vasanth's GO)
# Never via plain `supabase db push` / `npm run db:push`.
#
# Excluded on purpose: dco_single_owner_operator_concept, get_driver_owned_trip, godrej_dco_payable_classification,
# network_pool_bid_commits (not in this release, carried from earlier exclusions).
#
# Verify before applying:  npx jest supabase/migrations/__tests__/prodRelease20261103Set.test.ts
